@host = http://localhost:5080
@blastId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
@holeId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000

### Create a blast
POST {{host}}/blasts
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "B-042"
}

### Add a hole
POST {{host}}/blasts/{{blastId}}/holes
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "H-01",
  "position": {
    "x": 10.5,
    "y": 20.25,
    "z": -3.0
  },
  "direction": 180,
  "inclination": 15
}

### Charge the hole
PUT {{host}}/blasts/{{blastId}}/holes/{{holeId}}/charge

### Mark the hole ready (bonus)
PUT {{host}}/blasts/{{blastId}}/holes/{{holeId}}/ready

### Fire the blast
POST {{host}}/blasts/{{blastId}}/fire

### Read the projection
GET {{host}}/blasts/{{blastId}}

### Read the raw typed event history
GET {{host}}/blasts/{{blastId}}/history
